## Scenarios

### SMF ELF relocation extraction

#### returns exactly one entry for an object with a decoy .rela.rodata

- Verify: returns exactly one entry for an object with a decoy .rela.rodata


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: returns exactly one entry for an object with a decoy .rela.rodata")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val relocs = extract_elf_relocations(build_object_with_rodata_relocs_first())
assert_equal(relocs.len(), 1)
```

</details>

